# Line endings.
#
# This repository has `core.autocrlf=true`, which stores LF and checks out CRLF on Windows. All
# three of us are on Windows, and `.prettierrc` sets `endOfLine: "lf"`, so without this file a
# fresh clone would hand Prettier CRLF files and `npx prettier --check .` would report every single
# file as badly formatted before anyone had touched it.
#
# `eol=lf` overrides `core.autocrlf`, so the working tree matches what the repository stores.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything that is not text and must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
